LocLongDescription="This armour allows the user to scale vertical surfaces quickly. <Ability:TR_RockClimb_Item_Armour_HasCharge> a recharge time of <Ability:TR_RockClimb_Cooldown_Item_Armour/> turns. Each use costs <Ability:TR_RockClimb_AP_Cost_Item_Armour/> action points."
LocHelpText="Allows the user to scale vertical surfaces quickly."
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet/> Climb walls"
LocFlyOverText="Rock Climbing armour"


[TR_RockClimbingVest X2EquipmentTemplate]
FriendlyName="Rock climbing vest"
FriendlyNamePlural="Rock climbing vests"
BriefSummary="This vest allows the user to scale vertical surfaces quickly, making it useful for quickly accessing high or difficult-to-reach areas. \n <Bullet/> It also boost the soldier's health by <Ability:TR_RockClimb_Vest_HealthBuff> and mobility by <Ability:RockClimbingVest_MobilityBonus/>."
TacticalText="Allows the user to scale vertical surfaces quickly."
AbilityDescName="Rock climbing vest"

